<title>SINGAPORE: Isetan full year net profit up sharply.</title>
<headline>Isetan full year net profit up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   5.95  vs     1.99</p>
<p>    Final dividend (pct)    10.00  vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Special dividend (pct)  10.00  vs     nil</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	 18.00  vs     6.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		   268.90  vs   255.76</p>
<p>    Other income		 8.86  vs     8.89</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 7.08  vs     6.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     7.30  vs     2.00</p>
<p>    Gain from associates     0.04  vs     0.03 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax			    1.40  vs     0.02 (gain)</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain	 0.96  vs     0.44</p>
<p>Note - Isetan (Singapore) Ltd said the extraordianry gain of S$0.96 million was mainly from the disposal of a condominium unit and sale of a long-term investment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
